Marquessa Calliana Anatal Grave (colloquially known as Lady Grave) is the highest-ranked noble in [[Geography/Althane/Salores/Toleros/index|Toleros]] and a member of the [[Org/Althane/The Triptych|Triptych]]. She rose to power due to her monopoly over the saltpetre mines in the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/index|Lunae Badlands]], making her a crucial part of the [[Phenomena/Althane/Gunpowder|gunpowder]] production process. Since her ascent to power, Grave has invested heavily in research of and around combustion, and now funds a non-negligible portion of Toleros' scientific community.

Grave is a human [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Oread|Oread]] with jet skin crisscrossed by veins of reflective gold. She has harsh facial features, a sharp nose, golden hair, and eyes made of topaz.
